"""ryzenctl — privileged helper of Ryzen Control (Ryzen 7 9800X3D, Granite Ridge).

The only component that talks to the SMU (ryzen_smu driver) and to the fans. Same command
grammar for the CLI, the profile files and the `serve` protocol. With RYZENCTL_ROOT set it
uses a fake backend (the same as the selftest): no driver, no root.
"""
